{"version":1,"key":"card:471","content":{"id":471,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"要在属性被访问时执行一段代码，必须使用一些魔法方法。由下面的四个魔法方法定义。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1b0cbdaf-3d80-40db-a0c8-13acda41accb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"__getattribute__(self, name)","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：在属性被访问时自动调用","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ad0980a4-3d8c-4030-96dc-12d126b8c84c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"c864b8b7-69df-42fc-882c-fc5d39e2a917","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"__getattr__(self, name)","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：在属性被访问而","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"对象没有这样的属性时","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f74dc4d7-f95e-42f8-9a91-defdf5e12a62","color":"red","colorSelectOpen":false,"lineType":"solid","tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","type":"underline"},{"text":"自动调用","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"38939747-121f-4e49-8d57-e81b0ae7fe4c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"cdec36e8-8cb1-4136-a73a-bc3d9153c238","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"__setattr__(self, name, value)","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：试图给属性赋值时自动调用","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eb9beb6e-dd1f-4d6d-b244-847e9849dc9a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"88018600-5ac0-4e2c-8650-2b159b4de30c","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"__delattr__(self, name)","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：试图删除属性时自动调用","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"86402505-4f1d-42c5-91d1-6569cf884b93","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"401c89cf-5b99-4024-8e4c-30316d04f701","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"94ff5cb3-0de6-4c39-81cf-949b57695178","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Rectangle:\n    def __init__ (self):\n      self.width = 0\n      self.height = 0\n    def __setattr__(self, name, value):\n      if name == 'size':\n          self.width, self.height = value\n      else:\n          self. __dict__[name] = value\n    def __getattr__(self, name):\n      if name == 'size':\n          return self.width, self.height\n      else:\n          raise AttributeError()","collabId":"6cf1b187-0e60-40e7-83bc-feb5b1667f96","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"5f7b1bd7-6c3f-4ca1-b234-72781a47ddf1","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"48e0ded4-a101-4244-a730-59c8c5430efe"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Stats:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._count = 0\n\n    def __getattribute__(self, name):\n        if name == \"_count\":\n            return super().__getattribute__(name)\n        self._count += 1\n        return super().__getattribute__(name)\n\ns = Stats()\ns.name = \"Alice\"\nprint(s.name)    # 访问属性时记录访问次数\nprint(s._count)  # 输出: 1","collabId":"5935f326-1135-46e3-bbf5-3b9d40e5bebc","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"25568597-c239-4d84-992c-86c15c5f7c38","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f59ce1e8-7535-4a3b-bf62-e89e0bf80117"},{"children":[{"text":"相比 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"property","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，这些魔法方法使用起来要棘手些，在可能的情况下，还是使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"property","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 吧。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"88204d31-443e-447c-bd5c-ed955172c0f5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"note","children":[{"children":[{"text":"编写 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"__getattribute__","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 需要避开无限循环陷阱。由于它拦截对所有属性的访问（在新式类中），因此将拦截对 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"__dict__","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的访问！","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1a3b632e-8cb4-461d-9ec3-13d98929e44b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"__getattribute__","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中访问当前实例的属性时，唯一安全的方式是使用超类的方法 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"__getattribute__","type":"formatted"},{"text":"（使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"super","type":"formatted"},{"text":"）。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b976f19e-7101-488c-9639-c010eaead1a5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"d091c760-0bc5-49ce-903b-a1f3bd244a69","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"}],"tags":["Python/魔法方法"],"createTime":1719276760702,"updateTime":1793532526057,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532526057}}